OBS38 MIRROR - identical squads, equal ground, both ordered in.
  Each seed is played TWICE: once with player 1's squad as id 0,
  once with player 2's. A systematic bias shows as a lopsided
  tally in either the owner column or the id column.
  emberdeep_levy         n=48  owner p1=23 p2=25 undecided=0 | id0=21 id1=27 | mean 51.0s
