  stoneblood_heavy       n=48  owner p1=21 p2=21 undecided=6 | id0=22 id1=20 | mean 47.4s
  windmarch_cavalry      n=48  owner p1=23 p2=23 undecided=2 | id0=22 id1=24 | mean 25.0s

OBS38 COUNTERS - every shipped bonus_vs pairing, played both ways.
  'margin' is A's surviving fraction minus B's, averaged over 12
  seeds; a counter that is FELT should win most seeds AND leave a
  wide margin, not squeak home.
  emberdeep_archers      (x1.30 vs infantry) vs gildedreach_levy       favoured=12/12 other=0 undecided=0 margin=+0.44
