  gildedreach_spearmen   (x1.50 vs cavalry ) vs thornwood_cavalry      favoured=12/12 other=0 undecided=0 margin=+0.89
  gravesworn_spearmen    (x1.60 vs cavalry ) vs gildedreach_cavalry    favoured=12/12 other=0 undecided=0 margin=+0.85
